<title>LATVIA: TWO-YEAR T-BILLS TO BE SOLD WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>TWO-YEAR T-BILLS TO BE SOLD WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The finance ministry is to auction its first set of two-year Treasury bills worth 17 million lats at its next regular Wednesday auction, the ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The two-year issue will be sold along with 500,000 lats of 28-day paper and one million lats of three-month paper, the ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
